  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 1032838,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 1st Album: The (Commodore 64) - A Musical Adventure\n\nStep into the vibrant, pixelated world of *1st Album: The*, a groundbreaking and utterly unique adventure game for the Commodore 64. Forget traditional dungeons and dragons – here, your quest unfolds through the power of music!\n\nYou are a young musician, tasked with retrieving stolen musical instruments from a bizarre, surreal landscape populated by eccentric characters and bizarre creatures. Progress isn't achieved through combat, but by playing musical phrases on a virtual keyboard. Each level presents a new song to learn and perform perfectly, unlocking pathways and revealing the story.\n\n*1st Album: The* is celebrated for its innovative gameplay, blending puzzle-solving with rhythm-based challenges. The game's visuals are striking, utilizing a distinctive, almost abstract style, and the soundtrack is a crucial element, featuring catchy tunes that become integral to the gameplay. It's a truly unforgettable experience, pushing the boundaries of what a Commodore 64 game could be, and a testament to the creativity of its developers. Prepare to tap into your inner musician and embark on a truly original adventure!"
    },
